<h2>LearnWay account updated</h2>

<p>Hello {{ user.firstName }} {{ user.lastName }},</p>
<p>Your account has been updated by an administrator.</p>

<p><strong>Changes:</strong></p>
<ul>
    {% for change in changes %}
        <li><strong>{{ change.field }}:</strong> {{ change.old }} -> {{ change.new }}</li>
    {% endfor %}
</ul>

<p>If this was not expected, please contact support.</p>
